<title>UK: Leader Universal Holdings sets $96 mln convertible.</title>
<headline>Leader Universal Holdings sets $96 mln convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leader Universal Holdings Bhd has issued a $96 million convertible bond with a five percent greenshoe, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p>* * *</p>
<p> AMT    $96 MLN	 COUPON     2.75	MATURITY    05.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    05.MAY.97</p>
<p>NOTES  CONVERTIBLE ANY TIME FROM 15 DAYS AFTER CLOSING DATE TO 15</p>
<p>	  DAYS BEFORE MATURITY.</p>
<p>	  CONVERSION PRICE IS 5.533 RINGGITS, A 10 PERCENT</p>
<p>PREMIUM.</p>
<p>	  CONVERSION RATIO IS 2,263.4195.</p>
<p>	  FOREX RATE IS 2.5047 RINGGITS TO THE DOLLAR.</p>
<p>	  CALL FROM FOURTH ANNIVERSARY, SUBJECT TO 140 PERCENT</p>
<p>HURDLE.</p>
<p>	  PUT AT 129.2976 PERCENT ON FIFTH ANNIVERSARY.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
